<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/data-types/data-type/stac-catalog> a dt:DataType, rim:Concept, skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme dt:dataTypes ; skos:prefLabel "STAC Catalog"@en ; skos:definition "A STAC Catalog: a linked metadata object organizing STAC Items, Collections or child Catalogs."@en ; dct:source [ dct:title "STAC Catalog JSON Schema"@en ; dct:references <https://github.com/radiantearth/stac-spec/blob/master/catalog-spec/json-schema/catalog.json> ] .
